{"id":"662635","name":"炒冬鲜","author":"涛声依旧爱美食","authorId":"12824937","desc":"","cover":"images/662635/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"冬菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"冬笋","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"红萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"豆干丝","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜苗","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材。","img":"images/662635/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切丝准备。","img":"images/662635/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"准备。","img":"images/662635/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"冬笋丝焯水。油温高，入锅炒，炒到水分少，至少二分钟。","img":"images/662635/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加红萝卜丝，炒一分钟。","img":"images/662635/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加豆干丝。","img":"images/662635/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"盐一勺，因为冬菜本身是咸口的。","img":"images/662635/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加少许酱油。","img":"images/662635/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"一定要来些辣椒🌶","img":"images/662635/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"料酒。","img":"images/662635/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"最后来蒜苗和辣椒配色。","img":"images/662635/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"味精可要可不要。","img":"images/662635/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"好吃到暴。","img":"images/662635/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}